## CRITICAL: Multiple Matching Activity Structure (activity_multiple_matching)

**Column-based draggable items:**
- Group items in columns using `data-column-index` attributes
- Class: `activity-item` with color-coded backgrounds per column
- Attribute: `data-activity-item="unique-id"` - REQUIRED
- Attribute: `data-column-index="0|1|2"` - REQUIRED for column grouping
- Attribute: `data-id="text-id"` - REQUIRED
- Attribute: `draggable="true"`
- Color scheme: Column 0 = `bg-yellow-100`, Column 1 = `bg-teal-100`, Column 2 = `bg-green-100`

**Drop zones:**
- Class: `dropzone` - REQUIRED
- Contains: `<div role="region" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2"></div>` - REQUIRED
- Include numbered labels: `<p class="text-lg font-bold" data-id="REPLACE_NUMBER_ID">1.</p>`

Example multiple matching activity:
```html
<section data-section-type="activity_multiple_matching" role="activity">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_auto_auto] gap-4">
      <div id="column-sujetos" data-column-index="0">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="activity-item reusable-item bg-yellow-100 p-2 rounded-md shadow-sm text-center cursor-move"
               data-activity-item="text-19-3" data-column-index="0" draggable="true" data-id="text-19-3">
            Elena
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="column-verbos" data-column-index="1">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="activity-item bg-teal-100 p-2 rounded-md shadow-sm text-center cursor-move"
               data-activity-item="text-19-5" data-column-index="1" draggable="true" data-id="text-19-5">
            cocinó
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="column-complementos" data-column-index="2">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="activity-item bg-green-100 p-2 rounded-md shadow-sm text-center cursor-move"
               data-activity-item="text-19-10" data-column-index="2" draggable="true" data-id="text-19-10">
            al abuelo Enrique.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 justify-center mt-2">
      <div class="flex gap-4 items-center dropzone border border-gray-300 p-2 pl-4 rounded-lg min-w-[180px] min-h-[62px]" id="dropzone-1">
        <p class="text-lg font-bold" data-id="text-19-30">1.</p>
        <div role="region" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

**Key requirements:**
- Use `activity-item` class for draggable items (NOT `word-card`)
- Each item needs `data-activity-item`, `data-column-index`, AND `data-id` attributes
- Column 0 = yellow, Column 1 = teal, Column 2 = green backgrounds
- Drop zones must have `dropzone` class
- Each drop zone needs the inner `<div role="region">` container
- Include numbered labels with proper `data-id` attributes
- Use `reusable-item` class if items can be used multiple times
